 (Listing Obligations &amp; Disciosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, as amended, have been reviewed by the Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors at their meeting held on October 28, 2026. The statutory auditors have carried out a limited review on these results and issued an unmodified conclusion. &lt;br /&gt; 
